      "message": "This is in the \"Changes that must be incompatible, since they must change the VM identity.\" section.\n\nWhich I think is probably right, although it\u0027s not totally clear.\n\nBut if so that means we actually do need to feed this flag into the VM identity, and I don\u0027t think we are. (Here we are just testing the code that runs in the app context, but that is trivially bypassable - we need to make sure you can\u0027t boot a VM and get the same secret if you do so.)",
