      "writtenOn": "2024-06-10T02:19:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For clarification, `VirtualMachineConfig.isCompatibleWith` is not only for just checking difference of `VirtualMachineConfig`, but also for keeping VM identity ensured with DICE derivation, so the secret mentioned here is about DICE?",
      "parentUuid": "729e9d9e_2c20a398",
